      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Let's be completely honest. When you strip away all the fashion trends, seasonal fads, and complicated dress codes, there is one fabric that every guy relies on day in and day out: cotton. It is the absolute king of menswear. But not all cotton is built the same. A lot of mass-produced clothing uses cheap, synthetic-blended cotton that feels scratchy, loses its shape after three washes, and traps sweat the second you step outside.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
