      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "At Cottonworld, pure, high-grade cotton is literally in our name. We believe that your daily wardrobe should feel as good as it looks. Our men's cotton collection is crafted using 100% premium natural cotton, including ultra-soft Organic Cotton, breathable Cotton Bamboo, and flexible Cotton Elastane blends. From morning meetings to late-night hangouts, these are timeless, high-quality basics engineered to give you effortless style and uncompromised comfort every single day.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
