      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "100% Pure Cotton Shirts: The ultimate everyday essential. Our casual and formal [Men's Shirts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shirts) feature a soft, natural drape and a comfortable collar. They look crisp tucked into trousers for work or worn open over a tee on the weekend.",
      "protectedControls": []
