      "endIndex": 1833,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Classic Cotton Pants & Chinos: Upgrade your lower half with our tailored Men's Chinos and regular-fit Men's Pants. They give you the sharp look of a dress pant with all the breathing room and flexibility of casualwear.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
