      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Comfortable Cotton Shorts: When the weather calls for something lighter, grab our flat-front [Men's Shorts](https://cottonworld.net/collections/mens-shorts). They are tailored right above the knee to keep you cool without sacrificing a clean, put-together silhouette.",
      "protectedControls": []
