      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Everyday Cotton Polos: The undefeated champion of smart-casual dressing. Our [Men's Polo](https://cottonworld.net/search?type=product&q=mens+polo) combine the structured collar of a shirt with the breezy comfort of a knit tee.",
