      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[92]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6257,
      "endIndex": 6305,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Do pure cotton clothes shrink after washing?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00093",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[93]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6305,
      "endIndex": 6594,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "High-quality cotton can undergo very minimal tightening after its first wash, which naturally relaxes once you wear the garment for a few minutes. To completely avoid noticeable shrinkage, always wash your cotton clothes in cold water and air-dry them instead of using a hot tumble dryer.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00094",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[94]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6594,
      "endIndex": 6595,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00095",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[95]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6595,
      "endIndex": 6664,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "3. What is the difference between organic cotton and regular cotton?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00096",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[96]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6664,
      "endIndex": 6944,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Organic cotton is grown without synthetic pesticides, toxic chemical fertilizers, or genetically modified seeds. This makes it significantly better for the environment, uses less water, and produces a hypoallergenic fabric that is noticeably softer and gentler on sensitive skin.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00097",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[97]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6944,
      "endIndex": 6945,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00098",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[98]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 6945,
      "endIndex": 7004,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "4. How do I keep my cotton shirts from losing their shape?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00099",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[99]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7004,
      "endIndex": 7256,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The secret is proper drying and storage. Never hang heavy cotton T-shirts by their collars, as this stretches out the necklineâ€”fold them neatly instead. For woven cotton shirts, use padded or wide wooden hangers and always air-dry them in the shade.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00100",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[100]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7256,
      "endIndex": 7257,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00101",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[101]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7257,
      "endIndex": 7303,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "5. Can I wear cotton chinos to formal events?",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00102",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[102]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 7303,
      "endIndex": 7544,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Yes! A well-fitted, crisp pair of cotton chinos in dark tones like Navy, Black, or Charcoal paired with a tucked-in cotton shirt and dress shoes creates a clean, sophisticated look that is perfect for smart-casual and semi-formal occasions.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
